{"segments": [{"start": 0.43, "end": 7.05, "text": "Perasan tak sekarang? Semua orang nak jadi macam Khairul Amin sebab apa boleh buat satu juta dalam masa tiga minit", "words": [{"w": "Perasan", "s": 0.43, "e": 1.13}, {"w": "tak", "s": 1.13, "e": 1.29}, {"w": "sekarang?", "s": 1.29, "e": 1.87}, {"w": "Semua", "s": 2.17, "e": 2.43}, {"w": "orang", "s": 2.43, "e": 2.51}, {"w": "nak", "s": 2.51, "e": 2.65}, {"w": "jadi", "s": 2.65, "e": 2.83}, {"w": "macam", "s": 2.83, "e": 3.13}, {"w": "Khairul", "s": 3.13, "e": 3.33}, {"w": "Amin", "s": 3.33, "e": 3.59}, {"w": "sebab", "s": 3.59, "e": 3.91}, {"w": "apa", "s": 3.91, "e": 4.05}, {"w": "boleh", "s": 4.05, "e": 4.29}, {"w": "buat", "s": 4.29, "e": 4.51}, {"w": "satu", "s": 4.51, "e": 5.03}, {"w": "juta", "s": 5.03, "e": 5.45}, {"w": "dalam", "s": 5.45, "e": 5.75}, {"w": "masa", "s": 5.75, "e": 6.07}, {"w": "tiga", "s": 6.07, "e": 6.41}, {"w": "minit", "s": 6.41, "e": 7.05}]}, {"start": 7.05, "end": 12.89, "text": "Tapi sebenarnya untuk proses tiga minit tu, apa yang dah dilakukannya, berapa masa dah dikorbannya", "words": [{"w": "Tapi", "s": 7.05, "e": 7.37}, {"w": "sebenarnya", "s": 7.37, "e": 7.89}, {"w": "untuk", "s": 7.89, "e": 8.37}, {"w": "proses", "s": 8.37, "e": 8.67}, {"w": "tiga", "s": 8.67, "e": 9.11}, {"w": "minit", "s": 9.11, "e": 9.49}, {"w": "tu,", "s": 9.49, "e": 9.73}, {"w": "apa", "s": 9.79, "e": 9.99}, {"w": "yang", "s": 9.99, "e": 10.13}, {"w": "dah", "s": 10.13, "e": 10.33}, {"w": "dilakukannya,", "s": 10.33, "e": 11.15}, {"w": "berapa", "s": 11.35, "e": 11.47}, {"w": "masa", "s": 11.47, "e": 11.75}, {"w": "dah", "s": 11.75, "e": 11.93}, {"w": "dikorbannya", "s": 11.93, "e": 12.89}]}, {"start": 12.89, "end": 17.03, "text": "So itu sebenarnya bukanlah satu perkara yang satu malam", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 12.89, "e": 13.15}, {"w": "itu", "s": 13.15, "e": 13.37}, {"w": "sebenarnya", "s": 13.37, "e": 13.61}, {"w": "bukanlah", "s": 13.61, "e": 14.59}, {"w": "satu", "s": 14.59, "e": 14.83}, {"w": "per